{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dj1CB5YGV31794363301.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>最新北環綫主綫連同支綫，目標2034年或之前同步開通，較原先快兩至四年。北都鐵路專員葉偉民稱，統一及標準化鐵路設計後，會利用組裝合成法建造車站等設施。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.RTHK.RAIL.BITE-1000 (2).png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bDvJkrfocu1794363322.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>北部都會區鐵路專員葉偉民說：「引入一些預製裝配式車站設計，善用標準化的組裝合成部件供應鏈，便利車站構件的預製生產、現場裝嵌等。鐵路系統的技術規格方面統一化，可對接更高質高效供應鏈，取得大量供應，有不同款式和型號，從而提升效率。並沒有改變現行監察機制，而且維持績效指標及表現水平，亦會繼續在不同階段嚴謹把關，確保工程與質量合乎標準及符合法例要求。」</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.120446+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T19:36:57.979881+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:10.298761+00:00","content_hash":"29719bc5fdb013b36c6a6b8c06ffa9708dace65311b0da5a71f0e017d5457542","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.120446+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}